# Teta Website Rules

Business, product, and engineering rules. Visual language, color tokens, radius, type style, and component look-and-feel live in `design-language.mdc`.

---

# Project Identity

Official website template for **Teta / TETA**.

Business type:
- Wholesale supplier of automotive cooling and heating parts
- Products: car AC parts, heater parts, climate control components, related spare parts
- Audience: businesses, repair shops, wholesalers, professional buyers

Positioning:
The visitor should immediately understand that Teta is a trusted supplier for automotive AC and heater parts.

---

# Language and Layout (RTL)

The entire website is Persian.

Always use:

```html
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
```

CSS must support RTL. Prefer logical properties:

- `margin-inline`, `padding-inline`, `inset-inline`
- `border-start-start-radius`, `border-end-end-radius`

Avoid hardcoded `margin-left`, `margin-right`, `padding-left`, `padding-right`, and physical left/right positioning unless absolutely necessary.

---

# Technology

Preferred:
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

Allowed:
- Bootstrap 5
- Bootstrap Icons
- Standard CSS libraries

Avoid:
- Heavy frameworks (React / Vue / Angular unless explicitly requested)
- Unnecessary dependencies

---

# CSS Implementation

Always use CSS variables named in `design-language.mdc`. Never hardcode brand hex in components.

Font stack (visual rules are in `design-language.mdc`):

```css
font-family: "Vazirmatn", "IRANSansX", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
```

---

# Required Components

Build reusable pieces with independent styling and minimal JavaScript:

- Header
- Mobile menu
- Hero section
- Product cards
- Category cards
- Brand/logo section
- Search component
- Contact section
- Footer

---

# Naming Convention

Use BEM.

```css
.product-card {}
.product-card__image {}
.product-card__title {}
.product-card--featured {}
```

Avoid generic names (`.box`, `.item`, `.blue`). Prefer `.product-card`, `.category-item`, `.primary-button`.

---

# Product Data and Markup

Automotive parts cards must support:

- Product image
- Product name
- Vehicle compatibility
- Manufacturer/brand
- Availability status
- Wholesale information
- Contact CTA

```html
<article class="product-card">
  <img alt="">
  <h3></h3>
  <p class="product-card__vehicle"></p>
  <button type="button">تماس برای خرید عمده</button>
</article>
```

Card visual hierarchy and styling follow `design-language.mdc`.

---

# Responsive

Mobile-first. Must work at 360px, 768px, 1024px, and 1440px.

Mobile navigation:
- Hamburger menu
- Smooth open/close
- Accessible controls

---

# JavaScript

Vanilla JS only. Prefer `document.querySelector`.

Avoid global variables, inline `onclick` handlers, and large monolithic scripts.

Organize:

```text
/js
 ├── main.js
 ├── menu.js
 ├── slider.js
 └── products.js
```

---

# Accessibility

Always include:

- `alt` on images
- Semantic HTML
- Real `<button>` instead of clickable `<div>`
- Keyboard-accessible navigation
- Proper heading hierarchy

---

# SEO

Every page needs:

- `title`
- meta description
- canonical URL placeholder
- Open Graph tags

Use semantic landmarks: `header`, `nav`, `main`, `section`, `article`, `footer`.

---

# Forms

Contact forms should include:

- نام شرکت
- نام مسئول خرید
- شماره تماس
- توضیحات درخواست

Primary CTA labels:

- درخواست همکاری
- استعلام قیمت
- تماس با فروش

---

# Code Quality

- Write clean, readable code
- Comment complex logic
- Keep CSS organized; avoid duplicated styles
- Prefer CSS variables
- Keep JavaScript modular
